sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Student
  participant L as LearnPack
  participant R as Rigobot
  participant M as Model
  S->>L: run tests in VS Code
  L->>R: code plus failing test (missing JOIN)
  R->>M: analyze exercise and history
  M-->>R: root-cause explanation
  loop until tests pass
    R-->>S: highlight line, suggest fix
    S->>L: edit and rerun
  end
  alt tests pass
    L-->>S: Get Feedback, portfolio updated
  else still failing
    R->>M: re-analyze with new diff
  end
